LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 4)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# SPC/E water box: 1000 molecules, NPT at 298 K and 1 atm for 1 ns
# Tracks density vs time (thermo output every 1000 steps)

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

# ---------- Force field (SPC/E) ----------
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_modify     mix arithmetic tail yes
kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-5
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic

# ---------- Build the box ----------
# 10 x 10 x 10 simple-cubic lattice of randomly oriented molecules.
# Spacing 3.2 A gives a 32 A box, i.e. an initial density of ~0.91 g/cm^3,
# so the barostat has to compress the box toward the equilibrium density.
region          box block 0 32.0 0 32.0 0 32.0
create_box      2 box bond/types 1 angle/types 1                 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 1 extra/special/per/atom 2
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (32 32 32)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid

mass            1 15.9994
mass            2 1.008

pair_coeff      1 1 0.1553 3.166
pair_coeff      2 2 0.0    1.0
bond_coeff      1 1000.0 1.0
angle_coeff     1 100.0 109.47

molecule        water water.mol
Read molecule template water:
# SPC/E water molecule template
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  0 bodies
  3 atoms with max type 2
  2 bonds with max type 1
  1 angles with max type 1
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
lattice         sc 3.2 origin 0.5 0.5 0.5
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.2 3.2 3.2
create_atoms    0 region box mol water 482793
Created 3000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (32 32 32)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.020 seconds
# 'lattice' above also sets the distance units for later commands; reset them to Angstrom
lattice         none 1.0

# ---------- Settings ----------
variable        T equal 298.0
variable        P equal 1.0
variable        seed equal 4928459
variable        nsteps index 500000   # 1 ns at 2 fs; override with -var nsteps N

timestep        2.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity        all create ${T} ${seed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
velocity        all create 298 ${seed} mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
velocity        all create 298 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix             rigidH2O all shake 1.0e-4 100 0 b 1 a 1
Finding SHAKE clusters ...
       0 = # of size 2 clusters
       0 = # of size 3 clusters
       0 = # of size 4 clusters
    1000 = # of frozen angles
  find clusters CPU = 0.001 seconds
fix             integ all npt temp ${T} ${T} 200.0 iso ${P} ${P} 2000.0
fix             integ all npt temp 298 ${T} 200.0 iso ${P} ${P} 2000.0
fix             integ all npt temp 298 298 200.0 iso ${P} ${P} 2000.0
fix             integ all npt temp 298 298 200.0 iso 1 ${P} 2000.0
fix             integ all npt temp 298 298 200.0 iso 1 1 2000.0

# Report every 1000 steps (2 ps): total energy, temperature, pressure, density
thermo_style    custom step time etotal temp press density vol
thermo_modify   flush yes
thermo          1000

# ---------- Production: 1 ns NPT ----------
run             ${nsteps}
run             500000
